    "_postman_id": "3f36d32d-3443-4ea8-94f6-0a7c7af85d0d",
    "name": "TodoApi Sync Manual Tests",
    "description": "Manual Postman collection for TodoApi, ExternalApi, and the end-to-end sync test flow.\n\nExpected local services:\n- TodoApi: http://localhost:5083\n- ExternalApi: http://localhost:5090\n- Hangfire dashboard: http://localhost:5083/hangfire\n- SQL Server: localhost:1433\n\nStartup commands:\n- docker compose -f .devcontainer/docker-compose.yml up -d sqlserver\n- dotnet ef database update --project TodoApi --startup-project TodoApi\n- dotnet run --project ExternalApi --launch-profile http\n- dotnet run --project TodoApi --launch-profile TodoApi\n\nFor inbound sync steps, either wait for the recurring Hangfire job or trigger it manually from /hangfire: Recurring Jobs -> todoapi-inbound-sync -> Trigger now.",
